{"id":"a24e7d2d6214ca41bcd2b1b00c88bbaecd42cfd7","axis":"silent","repo":"solidjs/solid","sha":"a24e7d2d6214ca41bcd2b1b00c88bbaecd42cfd7","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/fix-static-runtime-prop-walk.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@","+---","+\"@solidjs/babel-plugin\": patch","+\"@solidjs/compiler\": patch","+---","+","+Keep an element reference for static props that compile to runtime writes, so a nested static `<select value>` no longer crashes the Babel plugin and the native compiler no longer writes a static select `value`, or a `selected`, `checked`, `value` or `muted` beside its `default*` prop, to the previous sibling (also a static `style` with `inlineStyles: false`)."],"additions":6,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/babel-plugin/src/dom/element.ts","lines":["@@ -1718,6 +1718,10 @@ function detectExpressions(","             t.isJSXSpreadAttribute(attr) ||","             (t.isJSXIdentifier(attr.name) &&","               [\"textContent\", \"innerHTML\", \"innerText\"].includes(attr.name.name)) ||","+            (tagName === \"select\" &&","+              t.isJSXIdentifier(attr.name) &&","+              attr.name.name === \"value\" &&","+              attr.value != null) ||","             // inlineStyles: false rewrites every style value into an IIFE","             // expression, so even literal styles compile to dynamic","             // bindings that need an element reference."],"additions":4,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/compiler/__tests__/dom-static-runtime-props.test.js","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,231 @@","+/**","+ * @vitest-environment jsdom","+ */","+","+const fs = require(\"fs\");","+const path = require(\"path\");","+const { TextDecoder, TextEncoder } = require(\"util\");","+","+const environmentEncoding = {","+  TextEncoder: globalThis.TextEncoder,","+  TextDecoder: globalThis.TextDecoder,","+  Uint8Array: globalThis.Uint8Array","+};","+globalThis.TextEncoder = TextEncoder;","+globalThis.TextDecoder = TextDecoder;","+globalThis.Uint8Array = new TextEncoder().encode(\"\").constructor;","+const { build } = require(\"esbuild\");","+const { compileBabel, compileOxc } = require(\"./parity/harness\");","+","+const compilerDir = path.resolve(__dirname, \"..\");","+const repoRoot = path.resolve(compilerDir, \"../..\");","+const workspaceSourceRoots = [\"solid\", \"web\", \"signals\"].map(","+  name => path.join(repoRoot, \"packages\", name, \"src\") + path.sep","+);","+const aliases = new Map([","+  [\"@solidjs/web\", path.join(repoRoot, \"packages/web/src/index.ts\")],","+  [\"solid-js\", path.join(repoRoot, \"packages/solid/src/index.ts\")],","+  [\"solid-js/internal\", path.join(repoRoot, \"packages/solid/src/internal.ts\")],","+  [\"@solidjs/signals\", path.join(repoRoot, \"packages/signals/src/index.ts\")]","+]);","+","+const source = `","+import { render } from \"@solidjs/web\";","+","+const views = {","+  selectValue: () => (","+    <div>","+      <span />","+      <select value=\"b\">","+        <option value=\"a\">A</option>","+        <option value=\"b\">B</option>","+      </select>","+    </div>","+  ),","+  optionSelected: () => (","+    <select>","+      <option value=\"a\">A</option>","+      <option value=\"b\" selected defaultSelected>B</option>","+    </select>","+  ),","+  inputValue: () => (","+    <div>","+      <input value=\"a\" />","+      <input value=\"x\" defaultValue=\"y\" />","+    </div>","+  ),","+  inputChecked: () => (","+    <div>","+      <input type=\"checkbox\" />","+      <input type=\"checkbox\" checked defaultChecked />","+    </div>","+  ),","+  videoMuted: () => (","+    <div>","+      <span />","+      <video muted defaultMuted />","+    </div>","+  )","+};","+","+export function mount(root, view) {","+  return render(views[view], root);","+}","+`;","+","+const styleSource = `","+import { render } from \"@solidjs/web\";","+","+export function mount(root) {","+  return render(","+    () => (","+      <div>","+        <span />","+        <p style